== Notes ==
* Gorseval has 2597 [[Armor (attribute)|armor]] (1374 toughness and 1223 defense).
* Gorseval has a 250 range diameter [[hitbox]], which is considered large.
* Gorseval has an [[Enraged (200%)|enrage timer]] of 7 minutes.
* Gorseval will focus on the player with the highest [[toughness]] attribute of squad members still alive.
* [[Spirit Thread]] (for [[Perfected Envoy armor|Perfected Envoy]] [[legendary armor]] collection) will only drop once per weekly reset, making the spirit weave time-gate of five weeks.

== Trivia ==
* "[https://soundcloud.com/arenanet/gw2-heart-of-thorns-gorseval Gorseval]", a combat [[Soundtrack|track]] composed by [[Maclaine Diemer]], is named after the entity.
* Gorseval is built on the [[wyvern]] rig. Originally, it used the same bipedal minotaur rig as [[Slothasor]] does.<ref>[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/animation-in-guild-wars-2-a-summary/ Animation in Guild Wars 2: A Summary], GuildWars2.com
:Jason said that Gorseval—which is now built on a wyvern rig—originally used the same bipedal minotaur rig that Slothasor uses.</ref>

