[[Destroy the ravenous wanderer]] is the third [[meta event]] in [[Gyala Delve]], starting immediately after the previous one. Finally on the surface, face a formidable foe with the help of your allies. Successfully completing the meta grants [[Exploring Gyala Delve|a grace period for exploring the map]].

