== Dialogue ==
;Event start
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''I'm back! Nothin' to see here. Just had to take care of some—''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''What the...? The hell did it do? Did it get bigger? And uglier?''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''In my experience, the guys who gotta act big and tough are always the most scared. Let's see if this is one of 'em!''

:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''The plan's still on: Spread out! Turtles, you work on charging up the batteries. The rest of you, grab those rifles!''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Snipers, shoot the big guy. That should give us an in, do some major damage.''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''And snipe some of that [[Haze (lore)|haze]] crap while you're up there. Our turtles can use that to supply power.''

;During event
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Keep getting that energy to the railyard and overlook! Got a little susprise for our guest here.''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Remember, we got that [[Jade Behemoth|"new shipment"]] over at the railyard, ready to be charged up!''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''These batteries need some juice. Charge 'em up!''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Give those batteries a good charge!''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Turtles, get that energy to the batteries!''

:<small> (Interacting with [[Battery-Charged Rifles]])</small>
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Go ahead and overcharge those rifles! We've got enough spares to keep us going. Leave 'em hooked up to the batteries.''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Leave those rifles charging! I wouldn't normally overcharge 'em, but we need all the power we can get.''

:<small>(Successfully powering up a [[Jade Behemoth]])</small>
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Ha! That's what I'm talking about! Beat that fool to a pulp!''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Hell yeah! That's what ya get when you mess with the [[Jade Brotherhood|Brotherhood]]!''

;Walking over [[Unbound Ley-Line Energy]] without [[Siege Turtle]]
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Whoa, hold on. You need the turtle's jade reactor if you wanna carry that.''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''What are you doing? You can't carry that yourself. You need the turtle's jade reactor.''

;Boss becomes vulnerable to normal attacks
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Here we go! Got it right where we want it. Let's deal with this once and for all!''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''It's time!''

;Event success
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''That did it. We did it. And that's why you don't mess with the Brotherhood...''
:'''Chul-Moo:''' ''Or our associates. Thanks for the help.''

== Notes ==
* One of the limiting factors of the fight is clearing the charge zones quickly. Since ley energy charges remain on the player (and can be delivered) after dismounting, it is recommended to do so to speed up clearing the zones (most players can out-dps the turtle's slam). Another tactic (more easily done for the behemoth) is to intercept enemies before they enter the zones and/or lure melee enemies out, allowing charging to begin before all the enemies are slain.

